flowchart TD
  A[Admission Officer creates draft] --> B[Enter student and parent fields]
  B --> C[Attach documents and review checklist]
  C --> D{Completeness passes?}
  D -- No --> E[Show missing fields/docs; save draft or approved override path]
  E --> B
  D -- Yes --> F[Submit for Principal review]
  F --> G{Principal decision}
  G -- On Hold --> H[Reason and status history]
  H --> F
  G -- Reject --> I[Reason and retained history]
  G -- Approve --> J[Seat limit check and placement]
  J --> K[Admission number + Admitted status; fee generation if structure exists]
  K --> L[No payment required for admission]
